Provenance
----------

Drumfire is a spiritual successor to NationStatesBattleSim:
  https://github.com/GhostlyBanjo/NationStatesBattleSim
  Original author: Forrest Davis ("GhostlyBanjo")
  Last upstream commit: 1f795fbd6c547ef4f5f073ca2c2821ffcbda2f85 (2015-05-18)
  Original license: GNU General Public License, version 2

The original Java source was not carried over. The domain model (force count,
morale, technology, training, combat experience, logistics, intel, home
advantage, and round-based resolution) was re-derived from the original
project's README and observed behavior, then reimplemented in Rust with a new
deterministic engine.

NationStates is a game by Max Barry. Drumfire is an independent project and is
not affiliated with, endorsed by, or operated by NationStates or Max Barry.
